    "name": "Poe Chat Models API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Poe API is a developer platform by Quora that provides access to hundreds of AI models and bots through a single OpenAI-compatible interface. Developers can call Chat Completions and Responses endpoints, list available models, and monitor point usage and balance using a single API key issued at https://poe.com/api/keys. The API supports text, image, video, and audio generation modalities and is rate-limited to 500 requests per minute.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Poe Creator Platform",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
